    <Description>1.3.1.0 - JSON file fixes and a user guide.
- T_StructFromJsonFileReader refuses a file longer than JsonParams.JSON_DOC_SIZE: it sets Error and logs both sizes, instead of overwriting its own settings.
- T_StructToJsonFileWriter no longer writes the terminating NUL at the end of the file.
- T_CheckFileExists.Check takes a T_MaxString path again (the 1.2.0 fix had not reached the source).
- User guide: docs/user-guide.html in the repository.

1.3.0.0 (not released; shipped in 1.3.1.0) - TwinCAT 4026 project with unit tests and a TcPkg package.
- TestRunner PLC project added to the solution: TcUnit suites for every public function block, run on the usermode runtime.
- Published as a .library and as a TcPkg package (Intecre.File) with Intecre.Utilities and the Beckhoff library packages as dependencies.
- Tc3_JsonXml no longer pinned to 3.3.4.0.

1.2.0 T_CheckFileExists.Check takes a T_MaxString path, so paths longer than 80 characters work.

1.1.0 simplified interface for T_StructurePersistence

1.0.5 Increased JDOC size.
1.0.4 Fixed bug in assigning CSV separator for CsvReader
1.0.3 Clear Read and Write Success flags on struct persistence when req'd.</Description>
